    "2000x1143 mm remains an approximate simulator field. Native grid anisotropy about 1.21 percent and conflicting 171/181 mm home margins are unresolved.",
    "M07 root footprint has largest boundary RMS (4.031 approximate mm); source movable geometry overlaps the base slice.",
    "M01 launcher and M10 tree circular datums have about 1.5 native-pixel picking uncertainty; yaw requires setup-photo/asymmetric mechanism evidence.",
    "Not every model has three independently identifiable stationary source-to-pad correspondences. Four asymmetric fixed footprints have explicit three-corner rigid checks and a fourth-corner check; other fits use complete fixed outline and photos. All use the same reference image, not an independent validation sample.",
    "M02 seeds, M05 root arm, M09 window, M10 cane/ring/chain articulation, M01 scan/drone/map poses and dock controls still need source-level start-pose work.",
    "3D mechanisms remain static and may disagree with current scoring state. Approximate 2D collisions retain their existing transforms."
